WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.934
Read silently for meaning, pause at confusing parts and check answers against the

00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:05.299
passage.

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:10.947
“The class planted seeds on Monday; shoots appeared Friday.” What happened last?

00:00:10.947 --> 00:00:12.154
Answer: Shoots appeared.

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:17.791
Read a short passage silently, then answer who, where, why and what-next questions.

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:21.710
Discuss why: The final event is growth on Friday.
